    "Floe isn't running yet. Open Floe and try again." : {},
    "Floe keeps the names of your files in memory, so file search answers as you type. macOS will ask about Desktop, Documents and Downloads." : {},
    "Floe lists the items apps put in the menu bar." : {},
    "Floe may not use Calendar. Allow full access in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Calendars." : {},
    "Floe may not use Reminders. Allow it in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Reminders." : {},
    "Floe needs Accessibility to list your menu bar items" : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility is the name of a permission in System Settings."
    },
    "Floe needs Accessibility to list your menu bar items." : {},
    "Floe needs Automation access to read the Finder selection. Turn it on under System Settings › Privacy & Security › Automation, then try again. (-1743)" : {},
    "Floe needs access to Contacts to find people" : {
      "comment" : "Contacts is the name of Apple's app and of a permission in System Settings."
