    "Floe reads the host names in your SSH configuration to find them in the search, and connects by handing the name to your terminal." : {},
    "Floe records the hosts, folders and programs each extension reaches. Its page in Settings shows them, and off forgets them." : {},
    "Floe renders List, Grid, Detail and Form." : {
